{"product_id":"brodecks-report","title":"Brodeck's Report","description":"\u003cp\u003eWinner of the Independent Foreign Fiction Prize 2010A murder investigation in post-war France becomes an exploration of the legacy of German occupation.From his village in post-war France, Brodeck makes his solitary journeys into the mountains to collect data on the natural environment. Day by day he also reconstructs his own life, all but lost in the years he spent in a camp during the war. No-one had expected to see him again.One day, a flamboyant stranger rides into the village, upsetting the fragile balance of everyday life. Soon he is named the Anderer, \"the other\", and tensions rise until, one night, the newcomer is murdered. Brodeck is instructed to write an account of the events leading to his death, but his report delivers much more than the bare facts: it becomes the story of a community coming to terms with the legacy of enemy occupation.In a powerful narrative of exceptional fascination, Brodeck's Report explores the very limits of humanity.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 138 x 199\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Philippe Claudel\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781906694685\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Mass Market Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 288\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45795802644633,"sku":"17RA-39781906694685","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ef5b8045502_Brodeck_s_Report-_WINNER_OF_THE_INDEPENDENT_FOREIGN_FICTION_PRIZE_Philippe_Claudel.webp?v=1760541731","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/brodecks-report","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}